[
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 1.86,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Welcome back to \"Author's Trails.\"",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 50,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s01"
},
{
"start": 1.92,
"end": 8.04,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Today, we're talking about transmission mechanics, and I'm joined by Luca Moretti, a mechanic from Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 51,
"char_end": 165,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 8.1,
"end": 10.26,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Luca Moretti, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 166,
"char_end": 205,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 10.26,
"end": 11.16,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
"char_start": 220,
"char_end": 238,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 11.22,
"end": 13.02,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "It's good to be back here again.",
"char_start": 239,
"char_end": 271,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 13.02,
"end": 15.54,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "This episode is sponsored by Notion.",
"char_start": 288,
"char_end": 324,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 15.6,
"end": 19.8,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team currently uses.",
"char_start": 325,
"char_end": 382,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 19.86,
"end": 21.18,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 383,
"char_end": 404,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 21.18,
"end": 30.72,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we get into the details, Chiara Ricci was a guest on the previous episode and mentioned that tire pressure is more important than suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 405,
"char_end": 565,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.72,
"end": 31.38,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Yes, that's correct.",
"char_start": 580,
"char_end": 600,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.44,
"end": 33.84,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And that connects to what we're covering today.",
"char_start": 601,
"char_end": 648,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 33.84,
"end": 39.6,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to point something out – Chiara Ricci mentioned the same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 665,
"char_end": 756,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 39.6,
"end": 45.42,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to point something out – Marco Bellini mentioned the same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 757,
"char_end": 849,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.2,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
"char_start": 850,
"char_end": 883,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 211.26,
"end": 214.02,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What were your initial thoughts on this topic, and how have they changed?",
"char_start": 884,
"char_end": 957,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 214.02,
"end": 222.3,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious squeaks are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 972,
"char_end": 1109,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 222.36,
"end": 225.42,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1110,
"char_end": 1159,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.48,
"end": 229.5,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what trade-offs you're making.",
"char_start": 1160,
"char_end": 1236,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 229.5,
"end": 230.94,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "It's a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 1253,
"char_end": 1279,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 231.0,
"end": 235.14,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1280,
"char_end": 1338,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 235.14,
"end": 236.1,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1353,
"char_end": 1373,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 236.16,
"end": 241.8,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "A bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1374,
"char_end": 1467,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 241.86,
"end": 245.94,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1468,
"char_end": 1539,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 245.94,
"end": 247.14,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to delve deeper.",
"char_start": 1556,
"char_end": 1579,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 247.2,
"end": 252.3,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the structural element that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 1580,
"char_end": 1653,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.3,
"end": 252.66,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1668,
"char_end": 1678,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 252.72,
"end": 258.48,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you will need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1679,
"char_end": 1784,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.54,
"end": 261.6,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1785,
"char_end": 1834,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 261.66,
"end": 265.68,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what trade-offs you are making.",
"char_start": 1835,
"char_end": 1912,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 265.68,
"end": 267.18,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 1929,
"char_end": 1942,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.18,
"end": 271.5,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this becomes clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1957,
"char_end": 2031,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 271.56,
"end": 274.74,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "I have observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2032,
"char_end": 2103,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 274.74,
"end": 276.36,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
"char_start": 2120,
"char_end": 2158,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 276.42,
"end": 279.06,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 2159,
"char_end": 2199,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 279.06,
"end": 279.42,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 2214,
"char_end": 2224,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 279.48,
"end": 285.0,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 2225,
"char_end": 2301,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 285.06,
"end": 288.96,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2302,
"char_end": 2389,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 288.96,
"end": 289.5,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "You know what?",
"char_start": 2406,
"char_end": 2420,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 289.56,
"end": 293.88,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I'm just saying: Linear manages all of my engineering operations.",
"char_start": 2421,
"char_end": 2486,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 293.94,
"end": 298.32,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2487,
"char_end": 2564,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 298.38,
"end": 300.6,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2565,
"char_end": 2599,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
