"char_start": 5076,
"char_end": 5102,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 1354.86,
"end": 1360.14,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the counter-narrative that most listeners are not exposed to?",
"char_start": 5103,
"char_end": 5172,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 1360.14,
"end": 1366.98,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "It boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 5187,
"char_end": 5303,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 1367.04,
"end": 1371.06,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 5304,
"char_end": 5377,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 1371.06,
"end": 1372.86,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the typical failure mode?",
"char_start": 5394,
"char_end": 5427,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 1372.92,
"end": 1377.12,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5428,
"char_end": 5493,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 1377.12,
"end": 1383.72,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5508,
"char_end": 5612,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 1383.78,
"end": 1386.42,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5613,
"char_end": 5666,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 1386.48,
"end": 1389.66,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5667,
"char_end": 5736,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 1389.66,
"end": 1391.22,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 5753,
"char_end": 5780,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 1391.22,
"end": 1399.38,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano components within that system, the compromise becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5795,
"char_end": 5951,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 1399.38,
"end": 1401.66,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 5968,
"char_end": 6026,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 1401.72,
"end": 1405.86,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do maintenance and the mechanics of the transmission intersect?",
"char_start": 6027,
"char_end": 6096,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 1405.86,
"end": 1412.22,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6111,
"char_end": 6197,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 1412.28,
"end": 1416.36,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6198,
"char_end": 6269,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1685.28,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6286,
"char_end": 6354,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 1685.28,
"end": 1689.6,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6369,
"char_end": 6437,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 1689.66,
"end": 1690.98,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6438,
"char_end": 6467,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 1690.98,
"end": 1694.52,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6484,
"char_end": 6542,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 1694.58,
"end": 1698.96,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 6543,
"char_end": 6615,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 1698.96,
"end": 1701.48,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Luca Moretti, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6616,
"char_end": 6661,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 1701.48,
"end": 1702.98,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
"char_start": 6676,
"char_end": 6694,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 1702.98,
"end": 1706.1,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Author's Trails.\"",
"char_start": 6711,
"char_end": 6763,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 1706.16,
"end": 1707.9,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "See you next time.",
